<title>UK: BZW names European credit research chief.</title>
<headline>BZW names European credit research chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays de Zoete Wedd (BZW) said on Tuesday it has appointed Gary Jenkins to a newly created position of head of European credit research in its fixed income division.</p>
<p>Jenkins, who joined BZW in March 1994 as a credit analyst from the Barclays group, will report to Robert Morrice, head of credit business Europe.</p>
<p>He will be responsible for the bank's sterling bond research, while developing research in the European credit arena.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
